  "updated_at": "2026-11-10T14:03:25Z",
  "body": "I have a fix for this in [this branch](https://github.com/angular/angular/compare/main...MeAkib:http/params-empty-array?expand=1): HttpParams now skips empty arrays when built from fromObject, the same way appendAll() and delete() already behave. The URL doesn't change; only has(), get(), getAll() and keys() now match it. It includes a spec. I'll open a PR soon.",
